            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Mose hara'aya gari oó' dír kaahamusmo Eleasari, nee dír Yoshua garmoó Nuni, nee dír geeraharuusér uren ar tlahh'aá múk Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Giri báy, «Barnaxes múk tlahhoó Gadi nee oo Reubeniwo taa waaraáhh gayuú yaaér Yordani, nee kuungane nee bar naa slaqwiyé' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gaa geerahaár, nee slaqwaraaro bara baaliindé', yaamu ngiri hayoté', daqaní yaamaá Gileadi ki hanisá' tawa aalir'ín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxés waarahhamuú gayuú yaaér Yordani ngu slaiiaaká oo tiwa alkoondá' nee kuungá' nee xosluuín kudaá slaqwaraaro, daqaní yaamu ngi slaye' baraá Kana'anír wa aleeró, dinkwa nee kuungá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.32.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
